@startuml tool2-bouncer
title Tool 2 - The bouncer (MCP gateway)

skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

rectangle "AI AGENT\nwants to use\na tool" as A #E3F2FD
rectangle "THE BOUNCER\nAre you allowed?\nRight inputs?\nNot risky?" as B #BBDEFB
rectangle "TOOL\n(send email,\nquery DB, ...)" as T #E3F2FD

A -right-> B : "may I use this tool?"
B -right-> T : "YES - here is a pass\n(expires in <60 sec,\nthis call only)"
B -down-> A : "NO - blocked,\nhere is why"

note bottom of B
  Every single tool call is checked on its own.
  The pass is one-time and short-lived, so a
  leaked pass is useless a minute later.
  Every decision is written to a tamper-proof log.
end note
@enduml
